    [
     1,
     "Hi Hailei.\r<br>\r<br>This has been discussed before as well.  You might start with:\r<br>\r<br><a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/browse_thread/thread/36d8c59d742fc503/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/browse_thread/thread/36d8c59d742fc503/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232096887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kPKkMn7SzDQkzsYRE-vfZ\">http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/browse_thread/thread/36d8c59d742fc503/</a>\r<br><a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/browse_thread/thread/f4d015cae1848f51/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/browse_thread/thread/f4d015cae1848f51/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232096887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw23yYRxS4j7h_mw1J25AA13\">http://groups.google.com/group/aroma-affymetrix/browse_thread/thread/f4d015cae1848f51/</a>\r<br>\r<br>You should definitely take log2 before proceeding with FIRMA scores.   \r<br>Since they are a summary of residuals for a probeset (see the paper  \r<br>for details), you will have positive and negative numbers.\r<br>\r<br>Cheers,\r<br>Mark\r<br>"
    ],
